{"version":1,"id":"keith-urban-blue-ain-t-your-color","title":"Blue Ain't Your Color","artist":"Keith Urban","key":"G","bpm":null,"bpmSource":"unknown","sourceUrl":"https://www.cifraclub.com.br/keith-urban/blue-aint-your-color/?instrument=keyboard","instrument":"keyboard","lyrics":"included","timing":"estimated","timingModel":"qwen3.5:4b","credits":"Composed by: Hillary Lee Lindsey, Clinton Wayne Ii Lagerberg and Steven Lee Tassone","chords":[{"symbol":"G","canonical":"G","keyboardPitchClasses":[7,11,2],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Am","canonical":"Am","keyboardPitchClasses":[9,0,4],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"C","canonical":"C","keyboardPitchClasses":[0,4,7],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"D","canonical":"D","keyboardPitchClasses":[2,6,9],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Bm","canonical":"Bm","keyboardPitchClasses":[11,2,6],"interpretation":null},{"symbol":"Em","canonical":"Em","keyboardPitchClasses":[4,7,11],"interpretation":null}],"lines":[{"id":"line-1","kind":"lyric","text":"I can see you over there, staring at your drink","columns":47,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-2","kind":"lyric","text":"Watching that ice sink all alone tonight","columns":40,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":23,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-3","kind":"lyric","text":"And, chances are you're sitting here in this bar","columns":48,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":37,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-4","kind":"lyric","text":"Cause he ain't gonna treat you right","columns":36,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":22,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-5","kind":"lyric","text":"Well it's probably not my place, but I'm gonna say it anyway","columns":60,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":11,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-6","kind":"lyric","text":"Cause you look like","columns":19,"beats":2,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":6,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-7","kind":"lyric","text":"You, haven't felt the fire, had a little fun, hadn't had a smile","columns":64,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":6,"beat":0},{"symbol":"D","column":42,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-8","kind":"lyric","text":"In a little while, baby","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-9","kind":"section","text":"[Chorus]","columns":8,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-10","kind":"lyric","text":"Blue looks good on a sky","columns":24,"beats":8,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Am","column":21,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-11","kind":"lyric","text":"Looks good on that neon buzzin' on the wall","columns":43,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-12","kind":"lyric","text":"But darling, it don't match your eyes","columns":37,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":5,"beat":0},{"symbol":"G","column":34,"beat":2}]},{"id":"line-13","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm tellin' you","columns":15,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-14","kind":"lyric","text":"You don't need that guy","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"Am","column":20,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-15","kind":"lyric","text":"It's so black and white","columns":23,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":19,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-16","kind":"lyric","text":"He's stealing your thunder","columns":26,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"D","column":21,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-17","kind":"lyric","text":"Baby, blue ain't your color","columns":27,"beats":6,"changes":[{"symbol":"C","column":7,"beat":0},{"symbol":"Bm","column":11,"beat":2},{"symbol":"Am","column":18,"beat":4}]},{"id":"line-18","kind":"instrumental","text":"","columns":1,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id":"line-19","kind":"section","text":"[Verse 2]","columns":9,"beats":0,"changes":[]},{"id":"line-20","kind":"lyric","text":"I'm not tryna be another just pick you up kind of guy","columns":53,"beats":4,"changes":[{"symbol":"G","column":0,"beat":0}]},{"id"